        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125915),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128552),
          text: '"He always wears a hoodie," Sameer said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128552),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131574),
          text: '"He hardly talks, and nobody knows much about him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132022),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 134922),
          text: 'Bilal looked up as children began staring.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135333),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136362),
          text: 'Imaan walked over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136362),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138142),
          text: '"Why are you blaming him?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138142),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140302),
          text: '"Because it has to be someone."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140302),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142662),
          text: '"That is not evidence."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143151),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144422),
          text: 'Sameer folded his arms.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144422),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145942),
          text: '"Then who is it?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148382),
          text: '"I don\'t know," Imaan replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148382),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 154310),
          text:
              '"And not knowing does not give us the right to choose someone just because they look different."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 154310),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157030),
          text: 'The park became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157030),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160070),
          text: 'Bilal looked at her with surprise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 161847),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163270),
          text: '"JazakAllahu Khaira," he said softly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163270),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165910),
          text: '"You are welcome," Imaan replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165910),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170150),
          text: '"You deserve the same chance to be heard as anyone else."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178485),
          text:
              'That evening, with permission from Ms Ayesha, Imaan and Akhlaaq returned to the Community Hall while a caretaker remained nearby.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178485),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 182352),
          text: 'The Golden Balance was still locked in the glass case.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182352),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185744),
          text: 'The muddy print was still visible on the floor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185744),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190201),
          text: 'They followed a trail of faint prints towards the rear door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190201),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196086),
          text:
              'Outside, the marks continued along a narrow path and then stopped beside an old stone drain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197206),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197766),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198406),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202006),
          text: '"Now I am starting to believe my ninja theory."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203286),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203286),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206726),
          text: '"Or there is an explanation we have not found yet."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208886),
          text: 'Something glinted in the grass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214119),
          text:
              'Imaan picked up an old bronze key engraved with a balance-scale symbol.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214119),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219616),
          text:
              'When she rubbed away the mud, a second mark appeared on the back: the number 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219616),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224208),
          text: '"A key, a balance and a number," Akhlaaq murmured.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224208),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226786),
          text: '"This mystery is becoming very organised."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227565),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231374),
          text: 'They heard footsteps behind them and turned quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233302),
          text: 'Nobody was there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236022),
          text: 'Imaan closed her fingers around the key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236022),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238622),
          text: '"I don\'t think this was dropped by accident."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238622),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241262),
          text: '"You think someone wanted us to find it?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241262),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244302),
          text: '"I think we should find out before we decide."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244302),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248942),
          text: 'For Akhlaaq, that last sentence was becoming familiar.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256590),
          text:
              'Fairness, he was beginning to realise, often began by slowing down the first answer that jumped into your mind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257910),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261870),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 2: Ask Before You Blame',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262590),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277798),
          text:
              'When something goes wrong today, do not accuse anyone on a guess. First separate what you know from what you only suspect. Use the sentence: \'Let us find out what happened before we blame anyone.\'',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283798),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Write one fact you know and one thing you were only guessing.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_03',
      title: 'Ep 3 · The Bronze Key',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/03_the_bronze_key.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 3 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 0),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2848),
          text: 'Episode 3: The Bronze Key',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 2848),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 7816),
          text:
              'The following morning the children gathered at Chacha Barkat\'s tea stall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 7816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 12751),
          text:
              'Fresh samosas had barely reached the table before Akhlaaq had eaten two.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 13016),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 15416),
          text: 'Ali pointed at the plate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 15416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17816),
          text: '"Weren\'t those for everyone?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22216),
          text:
              '"I was checking whether they were poisonous," Akhlaaq replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 22216),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24016),
          text: 'Fatima laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24016),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 26216),
          text: '"Such sacrifice."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 26603),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 31224),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq reached for a third, then noticed Bilal had not taken one.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31224),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34204),
          text: 'He stopped and pushed the plate towards him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34204),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 38104),
          text: '"No more poison-testing until everyone gets one."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 38104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 39504),
          text: 'Bilal smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 39504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43104),
          text: 'It was a small correction, but Imaan noticed it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47752),
          text:
              'When Bilal heard they were investigating the old key, he hesitated before speaking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52992),
          text:
              '"I saw someone near the Community Hall the night before the announcement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57392),
          text:
              'They were carrying an old lantern and walking towards the library."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 57392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 63112),
          text:
              'The old library stood at the edge of Amanpur, surrounded by tall trees.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 63112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 69720),
          text:
              'Instead of rushing in alone, the children went during opening hours and asked the librarian, Uncle Rahim, for help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71043),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72720),
          text: '"Assalam o Alaikum, Uncle Rahim," Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77720),
          text:
              '"May we ask you something about the oldest part of the library?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 81720),
          text: '"Wa Alaikum Assalam," he replied warmly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82405),
          text: '"Of course."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82405),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87688),
          text:
              'When they described the hooded visitor, Uncle Rahim\'s expression changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87688),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94688),
          text:
              'Someone wearing a hood had indeed come two nights earlier and asked about the oldest room in the building.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94688),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98688),
          text: 'He led the children to a small door behind a bookshelf.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98688),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101277),
          text: '"This room has been locked for years."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103688),
          text: 'The bronze key fitted perfectly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103688),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112613),
          text:
              'Inside were faded photographs, boxes of festival records and a large painting of the first Community Unity Festival.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112613),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116484),
          text: 'At its centre, a child held the first Golden Balance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116484),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122072),
          text:
              'In one corner stood another child wearing a dark hooded festival coat.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123257),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123257),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130664),
          text:
              '"Either that coat has been fashionable for thirty years, or our mystery just became much stranger."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133744),
          text: 'Near the painting sat a wooden chest.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133744),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137664),
          text: 'Inside it were maps, certificates and old letters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144344),
          text:
              'At the bottom lay a sealed envelope addressed: To the child who believes fairness still matters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144344),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 149092),
          text:
              'Before Imaan opened it, a heavy sound echoed from the corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152092),
          text: 'Footsteps stopped outside the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 155142),
          text: '"You shouldn\'t be here," a low voice said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 155142),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156831),
          text: 'The children froze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 156831),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161475),
          text: 'Uncle Rahim immediately stepped into the corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 161475),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164324),
          text: '"Who is there?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169389),
          text: 'Nobody answered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169389),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175901),
          text: 'The hallway was empty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175901),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175902),
          text: 'Akhlaaq\'s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175902),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175903),
          text: '"That was definitely not the wind."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175903),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175904),
          text:
              'Uncle Rahim closed the main library door and kept the children with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178560),
          text:
              '"Curiosity is useful," he said, "but safety is also part of responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 182560),
          text: 'We do not chase unknown people through an old building."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187528),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189528),
          text: '"You\'re right."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192528),
          text: 'Back inside the room, she opened the envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195528),
          text: 'The letter contained no treasure map.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197528),
          text: 'It contained a warning:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199528),
          text: 'Never decide before listening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201528),
          text: 'Never blame before knowing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205528),
          text: 'Never choose a side before hearing both sides.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208686),
          text: 'The Golden Balance is only a reminder.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 208686),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213082),
          text: 'The real treasure is hidden where fairness first bloomed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213082),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215537),
          text: 'No one understood the final line.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218963),
          text:
              'On their way home they stopped again at Chacha Barkat\'s stall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219954),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222696),
          text: 'His new sign was hanging upside down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222696),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225727),
          text: '"Chacha, your sign is upside down," Fatima said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228464),
          text: '"I wanted people to notice it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228464),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230584),
          text: '"They noticed," Akhlaaq replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230584),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233664),
          text: '"They just cannot read it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241104),
          text:
              'Everyone laughed, but when Imaan asked whether he had ever heard of a place where fairness first bloomed, Chacha Barkat became thoughtful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245744),
          text:
              '"My grandfather used to speak of something called the Garden of Balance," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245744),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248432),
          text: '"I thought it was one of his old stories."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249098),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249987),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251257),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 254832),
          text:
              '"Inn shaa Allah, tomorrow we find out whether it was only a story."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256312),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256312),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261152),
          text:
              'The bronze key in her pocket suddenly felt heavier than before.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261152),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266272),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 3: Listen to Both Sides',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 280600),
          text:
              'Choose a harmless decision with friends or siblings. Let each person explain their choice without interruption. Then suggest a fair solution rather than automatically choosing your closest friend\'s idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280600),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286081),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Repeat each person\'s reason fairly before giving your own opinion.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_04',
      title: 'Ep 4 · The Garden of Balance',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/04_the_garden_of_balance.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 4 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 719),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3687),
          text: 'Episode 4: The Garden of Balance',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3687),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 12327),
          text:
              'The Garden of Balance stood beyond the older edge of Amanpur, behind a rusted gate almost hidden by long grass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 12327),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 19367),
          text:
              'Because the place was abandoned, Ms Ayesha arranged for Uncle Rahim and a school helper to accompany the children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 19367),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24335),
          text:
              'The gate itself was old, but the heavy chain around it was almost new.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 28015),
          text: '"Somebody locked this recently," Fatima observed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 28015),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30895),
          text: 'Boot prints marked the ground nearby.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31284),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 35175),
          text:
              'Sameer and Haris arrived just as the children were examining them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 35175),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 38655),
          text: 'When Sameer saw Bilal, he pointed immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 38655),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40655),
          text: '"I bet those are his."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40655),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44223),
          text: 'For a moment, Imaan felt the pull of the easy answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 45923),
          text: 'Bilal was new.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 45923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47223),
          text: 'He wore a hoodie.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49223),
          text: 'The prints were nearby.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 55223),
          text:
              'She also felt something else: annoyance at Sameer for repeatedly making accusations.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 55223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 61191),
          text:
              'Her first impulse was to tell him he had no right to join their investigation at all.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 61191),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64191),
          text: 'Then she stopped herself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64191),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72331),
          text:
              'If Bilal deserved a fair hearing despite suspicion, Sameer deserved a fair hearing despite behaving badly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72331),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77831),
          text:
              'Fairness could not change depending on whether she liked the person standing in front of her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 86151),
          text:
              '"Sameer," she said, keeping her voice calm, "you may ask questions, but you cannot turn a guess into an accusation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 86151),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 90559),
          text: 'And I cannot shut you out simply because I disagree with you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 90559),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94679),
          text: 'We use the same rule for everyone: evidence first."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96839),
          text: 'Sameer looked surprised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96839),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98642),
          text: 'Bilal glanced at the prints.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99279),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101159),
          text: '"They are larger than my shoes anyway."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103927),
          text: 'Akhlaaq crouched beside them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103927),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 106527),
          text: '"So we have proved one thing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 106527),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107527),
          text: '"What?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107527),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108527),
          text: 'Ali asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108527),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110807),
          text: '"Boots exist."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110807),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 113607),
          text: 'Everyone laughed, and the tension eased.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113607),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117287),
          text: 'Uncle Rahim found a safe way through a side opening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117287),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121095),
          text:
              'Inside the garden, cracked stone paths led between dry flower beds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 132095),
          text:
              'On a metal plate beneath a loose stone, the children found the balance symbol and the words: Fairness grows where every voice is heard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138095),
          text:
              '"That sounds less like a garden rule and more like a community rule," Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153423),
          text:
              'As they prepared to leave, the little brown puppy - still being cared for temporarily by Akhlaaq\'s family while notices remained posted - darted behind a broken wall and returned with a torn piece of paper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153423),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157023),
          text: 'It showed a bridge, a tree and a star.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157023),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163671),
          text:
              'Along one edge were the words: ...only those who choose fairness will find the way.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163671),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 167591),
          text: 'Fatima compared it with the old page from the library.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167591),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169391),
          text: '"The edges match."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169845),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171551),
          text: 'Imaan\'s eyes brightened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174591),
          text: '"It is part of the same map."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174591),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179791),
          text:
              'Behind the wall, unseen by the children, the hooded figure watched.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185999),
          text:
              'The puppy suddenly barked in that direction, but when Uncle Rahim checked, nobody was there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190999),
          text: 'The next morning, the two paper pieces were placed together.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196999),
          text:
              'The complete message read: Only those who choose fairness will find the way.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199999),
          text: 'Uncle Rahim recognised the symbol.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200967),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206807),
          text:
              'His grandfather had once described an old activity called the Fair Path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206807),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214687),
          text:
              'Children were expected to solve problems together, listen to one another and make fair decisions along the route.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214687),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219207),
          text: '"So the map is not leading to treasure," Fatima said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219207),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223955),
          text: '"It may be leading to a test," Uncle Rahim replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226595),
          text: 'Akhlaaq rubbed his hands together.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227557),
          text: '"Finally.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227557),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230995),
          text: 'A mystery that gives homework."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231376),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231949),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231949),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240595),
          text:
              '"At least this homework might explain why somebody is guiding us through Amanpur\'s forgotten history."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246323),
          text:
              'By now the mystery was no longer only about a stranger in a photograph.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259683),
          text:
              'It was beginning to ask something of them too: would they remain fair when they disagreed, when they were suspicious, and when the answer they wanted was not the answer the evidence gave?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259683),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264411),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 4: Everyone Gets a Turn',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274451),
          text:
              'During one group activity, make sure everyone gets one turn before anyone gets a second turn. Politely invite somebody who has not had a chance yet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274451),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283709),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Notice whether the loudest person is receiving more opportunities than the quietest person. Help balance the turns respectfully.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_05',
      title: 'Ep 5 · The Fair Path',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/05_the_fair_path.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 5 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 29),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3129),
          text: 'Episode 5: The Fair Path',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3129),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 7629),
          text:
              'The map led towards an old bridge beyond the Garden of Balance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 7629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 14929),
          text:
              'Before anyone crossed, Uncle Rahim checked the structure and pointed out the safer planks and the support ropes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 15426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17097),
          text: 'Akhlaaq still stepped forward first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 19097),
          text: '"I\'ll lead."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 19097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 23097),
          text:
              'A plank creaked under his foot and he immediately stepped back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 27657),
          text: '"Or," he said, "I will demonstrate why nobody should rush."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 28324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 29257),
          text: 'Ali laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 29257),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 32497),
          text: '"A very educational sacrifice."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 32497),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 36657),
          text: 'The faded sign beside the bridge read only: Cross together...',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 41225),
          text:
              'Imaan noticed that the support ropes were placed on both sides.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 41225),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44745),
          text: 'The children crossed in pairs, helping one another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44745),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48985),
          text: 'When Bilal hesitated midway, Akhlaaq reached out his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49615),
          text: '"Come on.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50665),
          text: 'We\'ve got you."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50665),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56905),
          text:
              'On the far side they found a stone pillar with a slot exactly the size of the bronze key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 57433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58433),
          text: 'Imaan inserted it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67981),
          text:
              'A hidden stone slid aside, revealing a wooden box containing a compass, a faded ribbon, a notebook and another folded letter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67981),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72176),
          text: 'Before they could examine it, Sameer and Haris appeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72176),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74660),
          text: '"We found it too," Sameer announced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76953),
          text: '"You followed us," Ali replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77489),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78268),
          text: 'Sameer shrugged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82361),
          text: '"If this belongs to Amanpur, it belongs to everyone."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82847),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84594),
          text: 'Akhlaaq pulled the box closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84594),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 88281),
          text: '"You cannot just arrive and take half the clues."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 88281),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91101),
          text: 'Everyone started speaking at once.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 92754),
          text: 'Imaan felt irritated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92754),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100509),
          text:
              'She remembered how often Sameer had blamed Bilal and how he had followed them instead of asking to join.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100509),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104509),
          text:
              'Her first thought was that he had lost the right to be included.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104509),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109169),
          text:
              'Then she remembered her own words at the garden: the same rule for everyone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109169),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111049),
          text: '"Stop," she said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112629),
          text: 'The argument quietened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115149),
          text: '"Sameer is right about one thing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 115149),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116937),
          text: 'These records do not belong to us.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119937),
          text: 'But they do not belong to him either.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 119937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121937),
          text: 'They belong to Amanpur\'s history.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127937),
          text:
              'Fairness does not mean cutting every object into equal halves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 139865),
          text:
              'It means nobody is shut out merely because they arrived second, and nobody gets extra power merely because they arrived first."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 139865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143465),
          text: 'Sameer looked at her carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146945),
          text: '"So we all see everything?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146945),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148305),
          text: '"Yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148305),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150465),
          text: 'Same information.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153865),
          text: 'Same chance to ask questions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157974),
          text: 'Same responsibility not to damage anything."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157974),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162375),
          text: 'For once, Sameer nodded without arguing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163062),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164163),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164713),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168739),
          text: '"You nearly told him to leave, didn\'t you?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170566),
          text: 'She gave him a look.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170566),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171783),
          text: '"I nearly did."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171783),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 176833),
          text: '"And then you used your own fairness rule against yourself."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 176841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181841),
          text: '"That is usually when rules matter most."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 188841),
          text:
              'While the groups reorganised, the small notebook slipped unnoticed into the grass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 188841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195841),
          text:
              'After the children left, the hooded figure stepped into the stone circle and picked it up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200944),
          text: 'The first page read: The truth begins at the Clock Tower.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200944),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204578),
          text: 'Beneath the words was the number 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204578),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211619),
          text:
              'A loose slip fell from the notebook and blew towards the path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211619),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214478),
          text: 'It contained only a time: 11:45.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220937),
          text:
              'The next day Bilal found the slip near the Clock Tower fence and brought it straight to the group.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224176),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224857),
          text: '"JazakAllahu Khaira," Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227937),
          text: '"You could have kept it and followed the clue alone."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230017),
          text: 'Bilal shook his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234297),
          text:
              '"That would not be fair after everyone agreed to share what we found."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235374),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236297),
          text: 'Akhlaaq smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236297),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239603),
          text: '"Our team is becoming dangerously sensible."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239603),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247905),
          text:
              'The old Clock Tower had not moved for thirty years, but as they watched, its minute hand gave a faint jerk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247905),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248341),
          text: 'Tick.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248341),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249540),
          text: 'Then another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252745),
          text: 'The hands slowly moved towards 11:45.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256385),
          text: 'Imaan\'s expression changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256385),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259860),
          text: '"We thought the clues were only telling us where to go.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263921),
          text: 'What if they are also telling the hooded person when to act?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269317),
          text:
              'Before anyone could answer, a shout came from the Community Hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 269317),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270233),
          text: '"The trophy!"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274253),
          text: 'The Golden Balance had disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274253),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279801),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 5: Fair Does Not Always Mean Same',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279801),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294161),
          text:
              'Help two people in the way each person actually needs. One person may need more time, another an explanation, and another encouragement. Fairness can require different support for a fair chance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294161),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301609),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Think of one example where giving exactly the same help to everyone would not actually be fair.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_06',
      title: 'Ep 6 · The Missing Balance',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/06_the_missing_balance.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 6 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2545),
          text: 'Episode 6: The Missing Balance',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3345),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 8545),
          text:
              'The children reached the Community Hall with Ms Ayesha and several adults close behind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 9185),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 11015),
          text: 'The glass case was locked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 11015),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 13105),
          text: 'The front glass was unbroken.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 14648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 18013),
          text: 'Two security guards insisted that nobody had approached it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 18013),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 20873),
          text: 'Yet the Golden Balance was gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 20873),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25993),
          text:
              'On the floor lay a folded paper: You were looking in the wrong place.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25993),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 28153),
          text: 'The crowd began to murmur.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 28577),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33993),
          text:
              'Sameer pointed towards Bilal, who had arrived moments earlier holding the 11:45 slip.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34401),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37681),
          text: '"He was the last one to run in," Sameer said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37681),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40721),
          text: '"And he had a page from the missing notebook."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40721),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47441),
          text:
              'For one uncomfortable second, even Imaan felt the clues pulling her towards the easy conclusion.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49001),
          text: 'Bilal had a hoodie.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49001),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50401),
          text: 'He had the paper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50401),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54001),
          text: 'He had appeared at the right time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54001),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59369),
          text:
              'But the old letter returned to her mind: never decide before listening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59369),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66369),
          text:
              '"It looks suspicious," she said, "but suspicious is not the same as proven.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66369),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72369),
          text:
              'Bilal deserves the same chance to explain that any of us would want for ourselves."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73369),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stepped beside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76104),
          text: '"Questions first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77617),
          text: 'Fingers later."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79737),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79737),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82857),
          text: '"No one will be blamed without proof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 83422),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85537),
          text: 'Allah commands justice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 90617),
          text: 'We do not abandon justice because a rumour feels convenient."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 90617),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94017),
          text: 'Bilal explained where he had found the slip.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94305),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104225),
          text:
              'Fatima confirmed that the paper matched the material from the old notebook, but that proved only where the page came from, not who had taken the trophy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105025),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108073),
          text: 'The next morning Amanpur felt different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108073),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115987),
          text:
              'Festival decorations still hung across the streets, but conversations became quieter when Bilal walked past.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119233),
          text: 'Akhlaaq saw him sitting alone and joined him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120353),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123076),
          text: '"You do not have to sit with me," Bilal said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125713),
          text: '"People might think you are guilty too."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127560),
          text: 'Akhlaaq shrugged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129713),
          text: '"Then they will have to prove it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130673),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 134113),
          text: 'Bilal laughed for the first time that morning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134241),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142241),
          text:
              'At home, Imaan spread the clues across the table until the evidence seemed to cover every inch.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145241),
          text: 'Ammi placed a cup beside her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145241),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148841),
          text: '"You have been staring at those papers for an hour."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151921),
          text: '"What if we are looking in the wrong direction?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152468),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153561),
          text: 'Ammi smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 154209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158929),
          text:
              '"Sometimes when you are trying too hard to see, you forget to listen."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158929),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 166049),
          text:
              'That afternoon Akhlaaq and the puppy were near the Clock Tower when the puppy squeezed through a gap in the stone wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 166623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171129),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq called an adult before following into the small courtyard beyond.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171129),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174129),
          text: 'Under an old bench they found a rusty tin box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181177),
          text:
              'Inside were a festival badge, a faded ribbon, a newspaper cutting and an old photograph.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187177),
          text:
              'The article announced a Golden Balance winner, but the winner\'s name had been torn away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191177),
          text: 'In the photograph, one child\'s face had been scratched out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193177),
          text: 'Fatima turned over the badge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194145),
          text: '"Contestant Number 17."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194145),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204365),
          text:
              'Outside the library, Sameer overheard enough to understand that his accusation against Bilal had been based on almost nothing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204365),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206485),
          text: 'For the first time he looked ashamed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206485),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209703),
          text: '"I think I made a mistake," he admitted to Haris.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211325),
          text: '"Then tell him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211667),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215503),
          text:
              'Sameer did not answer immediately, but his certainty was gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215503),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226425),
          text:
              'That evening, with Uncle Rahim and a school helper present, the children stood quietly beside the Clock Tower and listened instead of searching.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229579),
          text: 'At first there was only wind and birds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229579),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233953),
          text: 'Then came a faint ticking from inside the tower.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234081),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236921),
          text: 'The group entered together.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245841),
          text:
              'Halfway up the staircase, Imaan found words carved into the wall: A fair heart is never afraid of the truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251281),
          text: 'A light appeared above them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251281),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259921),
          text:
              'The hooded figure placed something on the floor and disappeared through another passage before the adults could reach the top.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263205),
          text: 'The Golden Balance had been returned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263205),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266240),
          text: 'Beneath its base was the number 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266240),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270633),
          text: 'The same number was on the key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270633),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277686),
          text: 'The same number was on the badge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277686),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278597),
          text:
              '"Maybe the question is not who took the Golden Balance," Imaan said slowly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 278597),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283597),
          text: '"Maybe it is what happened to Contestant Number 17."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283777),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288217),
          text: 'For the first time, even Akhlaaq did not rush to answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289934),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293584),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 6: Put the Brakes on a Rumour',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305105),
          text:
              'If you hear an unconfirmed story about another child, do not pass it on. Say kindly, \'Maybe we should not blame anyone until we know what happened.\'',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305105),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309573),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Explain the difference between a fact, a guess and a rumour.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_07',
      title: 'Ep 7 · The Number Seventeen',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/07_the_number_seventeen.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 7 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3390),
          text: 'Episode 7: The Number Seventeen',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3761),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 9209),
          text:
              'The mystery changed once the children stopped treating the hooded person as nothing more than a thief.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 9209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 14209),
          text:
              'The repeated number was pointing towards a person who had been forgotten.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 14861),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 19209),
          text:
              'Ms Ayesha postponed the Community Unity Festival until the truth was understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 19209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25177),
          text:
              'Some families complained that this was unfair after so much preparation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25765),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 29297),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at the decorations hanging outside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 29297),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33137),
          text: '"A week ago I would have said the games mattered most."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33137),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33687),
          text: '"And now?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34054),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34513),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34513),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 42097),
          text:
              '"Now I think celebrating fairness while ignoring an old injustice would be a little strange."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 42097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47985),
          text:
              'At Chacha Barkat\'s tea stall, an upside-down clock suddenly began ticking after he turned it over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48705),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 53505),
          text:
              '"Sometimes you have to look at things from another angle," Chacha Barkat said proudly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54705),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 55505),
          text: 'Imaan froze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 55505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56465),
          text: '"Another angle.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 57025),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57825),
          text: 'The photograph."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66993),
          text:
              'Back at Uncle Kareem\'s studio, they stopped studying the hooded face and looked instead at the wall behind the display.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66993),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73033),
          text:
              'The thin wooden strip in the middle photograph crossed in front of the stranger\'s sleeve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76753),
          text: 'In the first and third photographs the strip was closed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76753),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 80913),
          text: '"They did not appear from nowhere," Bilal said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 80913),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 83193),
          text: '"They stepped through something."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 83193),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91301),
          text:
              'With Ms Ayesha\'s permission, a caretaker and security guard helped move an old storage shelf behind the Community Hall stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96615),
          text:
              'Behind it was a narrow wooden door leading to a forgotten service passage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101972),
          text:
              'A small hatch opened directly behind the Golden Balance display.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105588),
          text: '"So the front lock was never broken," Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105588),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108187),
          text: '"The trophy left through the back."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111219),
          text: 'Bilal pointed to fresh oil on a hinge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114404),
          text: 'Someone had prepared the passage recently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 114404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121867),
          text:
              'The passage continued beneath the old Clock Tower into a room filled with rusted festival equipment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121867),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127017),
          text:
              'One gear in the old clock mechanism had been cleaned and fitted with a new cord.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128017),
          text: 'Fatima smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131017),
          text: '"The clock did not wake up by magic either."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137017),
          text:
              'A faded board on the wall listed finalists from the first Golden Balance competition.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142017),
          text: 'The name beside Contestant Number 17 had been scratched away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148945),
          text:
              'Nearby, an old newspaper clipping read: Festival Ends in Disagreement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148945),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157705),
          text:
              'Only fragments survived: questions raised about the judges... many citizens left disappointed... a promise was forgotten.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157705),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160465),
          text: 'Uncle Rahim became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163305),
          text: '"My grandfather stopped talking about that festival.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163305),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164299),
          text: 'I never knew why."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164299),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 167877),
          text: 'An old bell rope hung from the ceiling.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168570),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169724),
          text: 'Akhlaaq pulled once.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171456),
          text: 'Nothing happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171456),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 176209),
          text: 'Bilal joined him, then Ali, Fatima, Sameer and finally Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 176661),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178692),
          text: 'Together they pulled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183713),
          text:
              'The old bell rang across Amanpur for the first time in thirty years.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187761),
          text: 'The vibration loosened a brick in the wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187761),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194041),
          text:
              'Behind it was a metal box containing a letter marked: Open this only when the bell rings again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194412),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199801),
          text:
              'Imaan unfolded it, but a gust of air caught the page and dropped it near Sameer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199801),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207169),
          text:
              'He read only a few words before the lights suddenly went out: Contestant 17... no evidence...',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207169),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213729),
          text:
              'When the lights returned, the letter was gone and footsteps were fading down the passage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214432),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218649),
          text: 'Akhlaaq took one step to run after them, then stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218649),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222789),
          text: 'In earlier days he would have charged ahead without thinking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222789),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227097),
          text: 'This time he looked at Ms Ayesha and the security guard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229977),
          text: '"We should follow, but not alone."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232268),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233337),
          text: '"Exactly."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236537),
          text: 'The adults led the way through the passage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245594),
          text:
              'The mystery was becoming more urgent, but Akhlaaq had begun to understand that fairness and courage both required self-control.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245594),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252345),
          text:
              'A quick action was not automatically the right action simply because it felt brave.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252345),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263793),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 7: Family Fairness Meeting',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271436),
          text:
              'Choose one small family matter - turns, a shared chore, choosing a programme, using a device, or sharing a treat. Give each person a chance to speak and agree on one fair rule for the day.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278731),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Ask whether the fairest solution must always give everyone exactly the same thing.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_08',
      title: 'Ep 8 · The Hidden Passage',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/fairness/08_the_hidden_passage.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 8 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 208),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3222),
          text: 'Episode 8: The Hidden Passage',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3222),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 5771),
          text: 'The passage opened near the back streets of Amanpur.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 6347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 15890),
          text:
              'The hooded figure was already moving towards the old bridge, but this time the children stayed with Ms Ayesha and the security guard rather than racing ahead.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 16351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24390),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq could see the stranger clearly enough to know one thing: whoever it was did not move like somebody trying to hurt them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24998),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30278),
          text:
              'The figure kept looking back, almost as if making sure they were still following.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34018),
          text: 'Near the bridge, one of the old side boards shifted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 39078),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq stepped aside too quickly and his foot slipped between two planks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 39078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44798),
          text:
              'Before anyone else could reach him, the hooded figure turned back and caught his arm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44966),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49366),
          text:
              'For a moment Akhlaaq looked straight into the stranger\'s eyes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 51086),
          text: 'He expected anger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 51086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54726),
          text: 'Instead he saw sadness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59966),
          text: 'The security guard helped pull Akhlaaq safely onto the bank.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59966),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64486),
          text:
              'The hooded figure could have escaped, but remained where he was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64934),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 69654),
          text: 'Slowly, he removed the hood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 69654),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72414),
          text: 'Several people recognised him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72414),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78774),
          text:
              'His name was Adeel, a young man whose family had left Amanpur years earlier.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78774),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 83334),
          text: '"I took the Golden Balance," he said quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 83334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 86322),
          text: '"I used the old service passage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 86322),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91090),
          text: 'I repaired the rear latch and part of the clock mechanism.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91090),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 92697),
          text: 'I left the clues.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92697),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97152),
          text: 'I was also the voice in the library."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99220),
          text: 'Akhlaaq blinked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100652),
          text: '"So... no ninja?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100652),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104870),
          text: 'For the first time Adeel almost smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 106870),
          text: '"No ninja."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 106870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110870),
          text: 'Then his expression became serious again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 118870),
          text:
              'He explained that when the muddy footprints seemed to stop behind the hall, he had stepped onto the dry stone drain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 118870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124838),
          text:
              'During the group photographs, he had used the narrow wall opening for only a few seconds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124838),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133998),
          text:
              'Later he removed the Golden Balance through the rear hatch so the front lock and glass remained untouched.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137478),
          text: 'Imaan asked the question that mattered more.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137478),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138638),
          text: '"Why?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 139089),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141438),
          text: 'Adeel looked towards the Clock Tower.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141438),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143958),
          text: '"My father was Contestant Number 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148976),
          text:
              'Thirty years ago he was one of the finalists for the first Golden Balance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148976),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152324),
          text: 'He believed fairness mattered more than winning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 157006),
          text:
              'He helped people and defended a child who had been blamed unfairly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157006),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162476),
          text:
              'But when a disagreement happened, people believed rumours about him before he was allowed to explain."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162476),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164726),
          text: 'His voice became quieter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164774),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168574),
          text: '"He did not lose because another contestant was better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168574),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170854),
          text: 'He lost because nobody listened."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170854),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178334),
          text:
              'Uncle Rahim remembered the arguments from his childhood and how the town had simply stopped speaking about the event afterwards.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180334),
          text: 'Adeel lowered his eyes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 182334),
          text: '"I wanted Amanpur to remember.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190062),
          text:
              'I thought that if the town felt confused and uncertain for a few days, people would understand what my father felt.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190062),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191902),
          text: 'But that was not fair.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191902),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194782),
          text: 'His pain explains why I was angry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194782),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199502),
          text:
              'It does not give me the right to frighten people or take something that was not mine."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199922),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201182),
          text: 'Imaan nodded slowly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201182),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204662),
          text: '"A just reason does not make every method just."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204710),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205781),
          text: '"I know that now."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206227),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207834),
          text: 'Sameer turned towards Bilal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 212033),
          text: 'For weeks he had repeated rumours because they were easy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 212033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216494),
          text:
              'Now he could see the shape of the old injustice in his own behaviour.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217270),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218978),
          text: '"I am sorry," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218978),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225370),
          text:
              '"I judged you before I knew the truth, and I helped a rumour spread."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225370),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229292),
          text: 'Bilal did not rush to make the moment easy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229292),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231138),
          text: '"An apology matters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231138),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236596),
          text:
              'But if the rumour was public, the correction should be public too."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237103),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237712),
          text: 'Sameer nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237712),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241285),
          text: '"Tomorrow I will tell everyone I was wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241285),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244438),
          text: 'I started it, so I should help stop it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246326),
          text: 'Bilal held out his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246326),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248606),
          text: '"Then we can start again."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251406),
          text: 'Adeel returned the stolen letter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251939),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253406),
          text: 'Imaan read it aloud:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253406),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259246),
          text:
              'To the children of tomorrow: If you are reading this, then we have failed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264366),
          text:
              'The Golden Balance was never created to reward the best child.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270334),
          text:
              'It was created to remind every child that fairness begins by listening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279854),
          text:
              'If one person is judged before being heard, then the Golden Balance has already been lost, even if it still stands on its shelf.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279854),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282374),
          text: 'Nobody spoke for several seconds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283974),
          text: 'Adeel held out the trophy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284582),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285982),
          text: '"You can take it back."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287902),
          text: '"You could have run," Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289394),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292942),
          text: 'Adeel looked at the bridge where he had stopped to save him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 298142),
          text:
              '"I have already spent too long running from the right way to do this."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 298560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301702),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha arrived with several adults.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301702),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308630),
          text:
              'Instead of beginning with accusation, she listened to the children, Adeel and Uncle Rahim in turn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308630),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 314070),
          text:
              'Then she said, "Tomorrow Amanpur will hear your father\'s story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314070),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 317630),
          text: 'And Amanpur will also hear your apology.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 317630),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323990),
          text:
              'Fairness means we listen to what happened to him and still hold you responsible for what you chose."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 325126),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 327558),
          text: 'Adeel\'s eyes filled with tears.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 335798),
          text:
              'For the first time in years, somebody had agreed to hear the whole story rather than only one side of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 335798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 341638),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 8: Fact or Guess Detective',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 341638),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353806),
          text:
              'Use an imaginary mystery such as a missing book or changed game rule. List what you KNOW and what you are only GUESSING. Do not accuse a real person.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 360499),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Ask what evidence would be needed before reaching a fair conclusion.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'fairness_en_09',
      title: 'Ep 9 · The Record of Contestant Seventeen',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/fairness.webp',
      audioAsset:
          'assets/audio/en/fairness/09_the_record_of_contestant_seventeen.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Golden Balance — episode 9 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 387),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3867),
          text: 'Episode 9: The Record of Contestant Seventeen',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3955),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 18475),
          text:
              'That evening, Uncle Rahim searched the old wooden box once more and found a sealed sheet labelled Final Judging Record - Contestant 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 18475),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22555),
          text: 'The next morning Amanpur gathered at the Community Hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 22555),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 23923),
          text: 'There were no games or music.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 28923),
          text:
              'The Golden Balance stood nearby, but nobody was looking at it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 28923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33923),
          text:
              'Ms Ayesha opened the meeting with salam and then addressed the crowd.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37123),
          text: '"Today we are not here to choose a winner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 41923),
          text:
              'We are here to hear what should have been heard thirty years ago."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 42449),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43891),
          text: 'Adeel came to the stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50891),
          text:
              'His hands trembled, but Imaan smiled at him and Akhlaaq gave him an encouraging thumbs-up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 53891),
          text: '"My father loved Amanpur," Adeel began.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 53891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59891),
          text:
              '"He taught me that fairness means standing for truth even when nobody stands with you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 62891),
          text: 'But he was judged before anyone listened to him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 63859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68379),
          text: 'Before you hear his story, I owe Amanpur an apology too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68379),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74539),
          text:
              'I took the Golden Balance and frightened people because I wanted to force the town to listen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79859),
          text:
              'What happened to my father was unjust, but that did not make my method fair."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 80991),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81839),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87827),
          text:
              '"We will listen to your father\'s story fairly, and we will judge your actions by the same fair standard."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91827),
          text: 'An elderly man named Haji Kareem stood in the audience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95827),
          text: 'He had been a festival volunteer as a young man.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98827),
          text: '"I remember the rumours," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100827),
          text: '"I remember people shouting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100827),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104528),
          text: 'And I remember that we never asked his father what happened."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109473),
          text:
              'Uncle Rahim brought the original festival records to the stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109473),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115285),
          text:
              'Fatima arranged the letters, photograph, badge and final judging record on a table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116040),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117492),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha read the record aloud.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123075),
          text:
              'The judging committee had reached a decision before completing its investigation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123075),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127050),
          text: 'No evidence had been presented against Contestant 17.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127050),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129492),
          text: 'A silence settled over the hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131671),
          text: '"We failed him," an elderly woman whispered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132427),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138329),
          text:
              '"Not because he did not receive a trophy, but because he did not receive a fair hearing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140711),
          text: 'Sameer then walked onto the stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140711),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143123),
          text: 'He looked directly at Bilal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148077),
          text:
              '"I was not there thirty years ago, but I nearly made the same mistake.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148077),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150348),
          text: 'I accused Bilal without proof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 155520),
          text:
              'I repeated a rumour because it was easier than asking questions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 155520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156415),
          text: 'I was wrong."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 156415),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159037),
          text: 'He turned towards the other children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159037),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162531),
          text: '"If you heard that rumour from me, please do not repeat it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 166737),
          text: 'Bilal did not take the Golden Balance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 166737),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169775),
          text: 'I accused him without evidence."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169775),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174159),
          text: 'Bilal joined him on the stage and shook his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174159),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178582),
          text: 'The applause that followed was not for perfection.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178582),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180899),
          text: 'It was for responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183667),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184557),
          text: 'Akhlaaq watched carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184557),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191402),
          text:
              'Earlier in the week he had thought fairness was mainly about turns and equal shares.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191402),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200083),
          text:
              'Now he could see that fairness also meant correcting harm after your own words had made something worse.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200083),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208675),
          text:
              'During a quieter moment, the little brown puppy escaped Akhlaaq\'s arms and stole Chacha Barkat\'s cap.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 208675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213675),
          text:
              'The hall burst into laughter as Chacha chased him around the stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216300),
          text: '"That cap is older than you!"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 216300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218675),
          text: 'Chacha Barkat shouted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220835),
          text: 'Even Adeel laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220835),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225727),
          text:
              'When Akhlaaq finally caught the puppy, Chacha Barkat pointed at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229443),
          text: '"You owe me one very fair return of property."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231195),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 235963),
          text:
              '"JazakAllahu Khaira for not charging him rent," Akhlaaq replied, returning the cap.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235963),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242083),
          text:
              'The laughter softened the room without erasing the seriousness of what had been acknowledged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242083),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245571),
          text: 'Then Ms Ayesha lifted the Golden Balance from its case.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255084),
          text: 'She looked at Imaan, Akhlaaq, Bilal, Sameer and Adeel.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263539),
          text: '"Each of you has shown something this week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266539),
          text:
              'Imaan defended a person who was being judged too quickly, but she also learned that fairness must be applied even to someone she finds difficult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275539),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq learned that courage without thought can become another kind of unfairness, and that listening and self-control matter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278539),
          text: 'Bilal chose dignity and forgiveness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283539),
          text: 'Sameer admitted his mistake and corrected it publicly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291507),
          text:
              'Adeel reminded us of a forgotten injustice and also accepted responsibility for his own unfair method."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293507),
          text: 'She paused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 296507),
          text: '"So who should own the Golden Balance?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 298507),
          text: 'The hall went quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 298507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301507),
          text: 'A younger child raised her hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304072),
          text: '"Why does one person have to own it?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304550),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305505),
          text: 'Imaan looked at Akhlaaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308968),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at the trophy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308968),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311475),
          text: '"Maybe she is right," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312195),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320302),
          text:
              '"If fairness is everyone\'s responsibility, giving the reminder to one person makes it look as if the job belongs to them."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320729),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321369),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321369),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 327443),
          text:
              '"The Golden Balance should belong to Amanpur\'s promise, not to one winner."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327443),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 332943),
          text:
              'For the first time, the meaning of the trophy seemed perfectly balanced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332943),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 343411),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 9: Make It Right',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 343411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 352274),
          text:
              'Think of one small moment when you may have been unfair - interrupting someone, taking an extra turn, excluding someone or judging too quickly. If appropriate, apologise and take one action to repair the harm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 352274),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 358163),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Use three steps: \'I was wrong.\' \'I am sorry.\' \'How can I make it right?\'',
        ),
      ],
    ),
