        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3496),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 4916),
          text: 'Ms Ayesha smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 5044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 10184),
          text: '"I think you have understood what the first festival forgot."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 10184),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17284),
          text:
              'The Golden Balance was placed on a wooden stand in the Community Hall where every child and adult could see it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17284),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 21304),
          text:
              'It would no longer be awarded as the possession of one winner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 21304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24679),
          text:
              'It would remain a public reminder of Amanpur\'s commitment to fairness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 27012),
          text: 'A new parchment was opened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 27012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 31012),
          text: '"We promise to listen before judging," Ms Ayesha read.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33012),
          text: 'The hall repeated the words.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34726),
          text: '"To ask before blaming."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37012),
          text: 'Again the hall repeated them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 41012),
          text: '"To share fairly and not shut people out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 41012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44012),
          text: 'To give people the help they need for a fair chance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44980),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47540),
          text: 'To correct ourselves when we are wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 51580),
          text: 'And to stand with truth even when doing so is difficult."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 51580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54180),
          text: 'The final words echoed through the hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54549),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56300),
          text: 'Imaan thought about the week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 56300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64592),
          text:
              'She had been proud of defending Bilal, but she also remembered the moment she had almost excluded Sameer because she disliked his behaviour.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68948),
          text:
              'Fairness had required something harder than defending a friend.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74948),
          text:
              'It had required her to use the same standard when her feelings pulled in the opposite direction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87034),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq thought about the samosas, the bridge, Bilal sitting alone, the rush to chase the stranger and the moment he had finally stopped himself to ask for adult help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87034),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89681),
          text: 'Fairness had not made him less brave.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89681),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97276),
          text:
              'It had taught him that other people\'s rights, safety and voices mattered as much as his own excitement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 97276),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100820),
          text: 'The Community Unity Festival reopened that evening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100820),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107384),
          text:
              'The Garden of Balance was restored, not as a secret adventure ground but as a supervised community garden.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119164),
          text:
              'The old hidden room in the library became a small Fairness Museum, preserving the letters, the photographs and the record of Contestant 17 so Amanpur would not forget again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 119598),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124844),
          text:
              'Sameer invited Bilal into a football match and passed him the ball without making a show of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131852),
          text:
              'Uncle Rahim watched the children reading the old records and whispered, "Alhamdulillah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137455),
          text:
              'Sometimes remembering the truth is the first step towards repairing it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137838),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141300),
          text: 'Adeel remained responsible for the harm he had caused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151720),
          text:
              'He apologised to the community, helped restore the places he had disturbed, and agreed to work with the adults rather than hiding behind clues.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160060),
          text:
              'The town did not pretend his actions were harmless, but neither did it repeat the old mistake of refusing to hear him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160060),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164780),
          text:
              'A few days later, nobody had responded to the notices about the little brown puppy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164788),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174028),
          text:
              'After checking with nearby families and a local animal-care volunteer, Ammi and Abbu agreed that Akhlaaq could keep caring for him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179228),
          text:
              '"Mashaa Allah," Ammi said as the puppy curled up beside Akhlaaq\'s shoes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181428),
          text: '"He seems to have found a home."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182328),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183228),
          text: 'Akhlaaq smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187656),
          text: '"And this time I waited before declaring him mine."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 188180),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189096),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189096),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190596),
          text: '"Growth."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190596),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196536),
          text:
              'One evening the siblings sat beneath the old banyan tree while the puppy slept between them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196536),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200896),
          text:
              'The Golden Balance could be seen through the Community Hall window.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200896),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204376),
          text: '"Do you think fairness means everyone gets the same thing?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205269),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205269),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207013),
          text: '"No," Imaan replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207013),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 212244),
          text: '"It means everyone is treated justly and gets a fair chance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 212244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216724),
          text:
              'Sometimes two people need different kinds of help to have that chance."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217430),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 221567),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq thought about Bilal, Sameer, Adeel and the old bridge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 221567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224644),
          text: '"So fair does not always mean identical."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225137),
          text: '"Right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225137),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232692),
          text:
              'But everyone deserves the same basic dignity and the same right to be heard before they are judged."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233339),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233894),
          text: 'Akhlaaq nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237132),
          text: '"I like that better than \'everyone gets half\'.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237132),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240852),
          text:
              'It would have been difficult to divide the Golden Balance anyway."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241502),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242412),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242412),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244652),
          text: 'Then Akhlaaq became thoughtful again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247660),
          text: '"And if someone has done something wrong?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 250660),
          text: '"We still listen fairly," Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 250660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 254660),
          text:
              '"Listening does not mean pretending the wrong thing was right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 254660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259660),
          text:
              'It means we understand the truth before deciding what responsibility looks like."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260243),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262660),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked towards the Community Hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267348),
          text: '"So the trophy was never really the most important thing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267683),
          text: '"No."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267683),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269860),
          text: '"The promise was."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270530),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271535),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271535),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272708),
          text: '"Exactly."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277428),
          text:
              'As the evening adhan drifted across Amanpur, they stood to go home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282988),
          text:
              'The Golden Balance remained where everyone could see it - not as a prize, but as a promise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284737),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290536),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day 10: My Golden Balance Promise',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290536),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304216),
          text:
              'Write or draw one fairness promise for the next seven days, such as \'I will listen before judging,\' \'I will give others a fair turn,\' or \'I will not spread rumours.\' Share it with someone who can encourage you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304564),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311802),
          text:
              'Level-Up: At the end of the week, write one sentence about the hardest moment when you chose fairness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313898),
          text: 'Overall Moral of the Story',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 313898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 318404),
          text: 'Fairness is not about treating everyone exactly the same.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 318404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 332252),
          text:
              'It is about treating every person with justice, giving everyone a fair opportunity to be heard, and recognising that different people may sometimes need different kinds of support to have a fair chance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332252),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 349780),
          text:
              'A fair person listens before judging, checks evidence instead of following rumours or appearances, shares access without unfairly shutting others out, admits mistakes, repairs harm and stands for what is right even when it is difficult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 349780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 352780),
          text: 'Islamic Reference Notes',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 352780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359700),
          text:
              'The moral value of fairness (\'adl) is deeply rooted in the Qur\'an and Sunnah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359700),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363620),
          text:
              'These references support the principles used throughout the story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 364468),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 365455),
          text: 'Surah An-Nahl 16:90',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 368268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 376788),
          text:
              'Allah commands justice, kindness and generosity, and forbids immorality, wrongdoing and oppression.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377288),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 382728),
          text:
              'The verse establishes justice (\'adl) as a core Islamic command.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 383328),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 387956),
          text: 'Surah An-Nisa 4:135',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 387956),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 397236),
          text:
              'Believers are commanded to stand firmly for justice, even when the truth is against themselves, their parents or close relatives.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401996),
          text:
              'Fairness is therefore not based on friendship or personal benefit.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401996),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 404404),
          text: 'Surah Al-Ma\'idah 5:8',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 404404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 410404),
          text:
              'Believers are told not to let dislike of a people prevent them from being just.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 410404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 415404),
          text:
              'Justice must remain consistent even when emotions are involved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 415404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 422404),
          text:
              'Sahih al-Bukhari - \'Help your brother, whether he is an oppressor or the one being oppressed\'',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 422404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 429852),
          text:
              'The companions were taught that helping an oppressor includes preventing him from oppression.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 429852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436172),
          text:
              'Fairness protects the person harmed while also stopping the wrongdoer from continuing injustice.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
